        },
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sinh-vien", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "sinh-vien"] },
        "description": "T10. Body thieu dau ngoac nhon.\nKy vong: 400 Bad Request va phan hoi la JSON, KHONG phai trang HTML loi mac dinh cua Express.\n\nLy do: express.json() nem loi TRUOC khi controller chay, nen loi nay khong di qua AppError. Do do error.middleware phai nhan rieng truong hop entity.parse.failed moi tra duoc JSON 400."
      },
